      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Sin descripción disponible.",
        "en": "This Pokémon cannot have its accuracy lowered.\n\nThis ability does not prevent any accuracy losses other than stat modifiers, such as the accuracy cut from fog; nor does it prevent other Pokémon's evasion from making this Pokémon's moves less accurate.  This Pokémon can still be passed negative accuracy modifiers through Heart Swap.\n\nOverworld: If the first Pokémon in the party has this ability, any random encounter with a Pokémon five or more levels lower than it has a 50% chance of being skipped."
      }
    },
